  (text "C8: VBAT pin10. C75: VDD_IN pin1. C76: VBAT_IO pin11.\nAll use the same +3V3 rail; place each close to its pin.\nC9 replaces the incorrect 100nF with Semtech reference 470nF."
    (at 35.56 220.98 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a3427f37-83bb-5ab6-8316-0865927974dc"))
  (text "SetRegulatorMode(0x01) only in STDBY_RC, after hardware qualification.\nL12 supplies the core, not the SX1262 high-power PA.\nPA choke/bypass and final RF placement/routing remain open.\nC10 PA bypass and J20 antenna connection remain provisional."
    (at 218.44 266.7 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e46f7df7-9edf-5c5e-8778-1e93165d9bbf"))
